        "PMC5893566::web::019::dislocation_mechanisms_for_fcc_to_hcp_ph"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The greater HCP nanolath density in CrCoNi will produce increased strain hardening and improved ductility relative to CrMnFeCoNi.",
